+	// [barreplay] H126 (toggle3 0x400000): Update() in its three parts, so the
+	// map work of every type can run as one set of tasks (CLosHandler's
+	// BrUpdateTypes). BrUpdateBegin is Update's queues and filtering (false:
+	// its early exit); BrStageMapWork then sorts the map work by ally team, in
